# Load order matters: Core.lua defines the shared "ns" table the other files use,
# and Options.lua dispatches /sink items, /sink recipes, /sink errors, /sink map and
# /sink dump to the modules. MapPins.xml holds the map pin template that MapPins.lua
# fills in; Dump.lua uses helpers from Recipes.lua and MapPins.lua.
Core.lua
QuestItems.lua
Recipes.lua
Errors.lua
MapPins.lua
MapPins.xml
Dump.lua
Options.lua
